    "background_story": "Ezekiel was a brilliant cybersecurity expert known for his lightning-fast reflexes in the digital world. As the chief security officer of a top-secret government agency, he was responsible for protecting sensitive information from cyber threats. Ezekiel's team affectionately called him 'Sec' due to his uncanny ability to detect and neutralize security breaches in a matter of seconds. His expertise was put to the test when a rogue hacker attempted to infiltrate the agency's mainframe. Ezekiel sprang into action, racing against the clock to outmaneuver the attacker. In a heart-stopping 30 seconds, he successfully contained the threat, earning him the nickname 'Sec' and cementing his reputation as one of the fastest and most skilled cybersecurity experts in the business.",
